 "dossier": "AURON · 1 OF 3 “Start with the first one.” Click its picture to begin. The others wait on the board. ESC SKIP THE GUIDE CHAPTER SELECT CHAPTER I Seymour Flux 0 OF 19 BEATEN X I II III VII VIII IX X XII XIV XVII XVIII XXVII X-2 IV V VI XI XIII XV XVI The mountain of the Ronso, and what was done to them The Ronso held the gate so the summoner could pass. Seymour calls it mercy. He is still unsent, he is waiting on the trail, and everything he says about Jecht is true. CTB FINAL FANTASY X I Seymour Flux II Lady Yunalesca III Braska's Final Aeon VII Seymour and Anima VIII Evrae IX Yojimbo X Seymour Natus XII Seymour Omnis XIV Isaaru XVII Sin: the Fins and the Core XVIII Sin: the Face XXVII Mirror Aeons FINAL FANTASY X-2 IV Bahamut V Vegnagun VI Leblanc XI Fallen Aeons XIII Trema XV The Den of Woe XVI Ixion LOCATION Mt. Gagazet — the Prominence BOSS Seymour Flux + Mortiorchis PARTY T TIDUS Y ",
 "prepText": "AURON · 2 OF 3 “Your party is ready.” The tabs are for later. Start the battle. ESC SKIP THE GUIDE PARTY PREP I · SEYMOUR FLUX — MT. GAGAZET — THE PROMINENCE T Tidus S.LV 30 Y Yuna S.LV 32 K Kimahri S.LV 25 A Auron S.LV 35 W Wakka S.LV 30 L Lulu S.LV 30 R Rikku S.LV 42 CHAPTER STATS SPHERE GRID EQUIPMENT ITEMS OVERDRIVE FFX · I Seymour Flux The Prominence The Ronso died holding this gate, and Seymour is still standing over the bodies when the party arrives. He is offering the pilgrimage's ending early, and he is not lying about the cost. the Prominence, at last unhurried, always unhurried the machine beneath him OBJECTIVES Holy Water a Zombie before Full-Life lands Survive Total Annihilation Defeat Seymour Flux TIP Bio him turn one — it deals a straight percentage every enemy turn and never triggers his HP-threshold reactions, so Protect and Reflect come out late. START BATTLE T Tidus HP 2420/2420 · MP 115/115 WARRIOR Y Yuna HP 1500/1500 · MP 270/270 SUMMONER K Kimahri HP 2310/2310 · MP 130/130 STOIC",
